+    /// images of both under `invert` / `swap_channels` /
+    /// `prune_extremal_channel_into`. (A single-vector set is *not* reachable:
+    /// comparators preserve the all-zeros and all-ones vectors, so every
+    /// genuine output set has at least two elements.)
+    #[test]
+    fn pathological_sets_bit_identical() {
